8ba444e8-22fc-4451-bc18-0a0f92f2929d-0
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:21.700
Pay attention to that horizontal
air flow and that side of the

8ba444e8-22fc-4451-bc18-0a0f92f2929d-1
00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:22.400
prep pad.

2e9921dc-9690-4c2e-8ca3-9f34e51a0850-0
