We're going to remove the
syringe, making sure that that

fc673fb1-0bce-4cdf-82b0-5aa359835c2a-1
00:01:42.241 --> 00:01:44.600
syringe tip stays in the air
flow.

fd29f286-2ee2-47a7-b8e7-788a3a123fc3-0
