We'll peel back the packaging of
our needle.

c38ee332-f189-47fa-bc35-de4440cfae9d-0
00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.840
We'll attach the needle to the
syringe.

bd71e490-586b-4a72-b79b-061a302e0f21-0
