We'll pull the flat knob back to
the volume that we need for our

921297e5-dcf1-4e45-9e2e-ffabdb803b87-1
00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:08.480
patient dose.

dfce98b2-7bc2-4a15-8dc6-36ff07b3354f-0
00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:13.080
We will get into a dark
position.

795a2d79-dd78-4ff5-b472-96789c2d60f1-0
00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:20.940
We want to take the cap off and
we'll put it on that sterile IPA

795a2d79-dd78-4ff5-b472-96789c2d60f1-1
00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:21.440
swab.

f39314b9-2580-4fb2-b305-95af6ded5b07-0
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.400
You want to be bevel up.

ea7567f4-f4c8-40f9-88bd-5e1501a7855c-0
00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:30.685
You'll tippy toe to 12:00, and
6:00 will invert the vial by the

ea7567f4-f4c8-40f9-88bd-5e1501a7855c-1
00:02:30.685 --> 00:02:31.320
