You'll pull the syringe so that
the needle is in liquid.

9151d3cf-8274-45ff-b732-388bd6ed6d62-0
00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.240
We'll begin the milking method.

6ccc522b-1fd9-42ce-906d-01cca5909cf9-0
00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:42.810
We have the forefinger and
middle finger that are on the

6ccc522b-1fd9-42ce-906d-01cca5909cf9-1
00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:44.200
