c9ae1873-459d-4892-b285-7b87f5d540b1-0
00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:49.146
The thumb will push against the
flat knob, and as you milk,

c9ae1873-459d-4892-b285-7b87f5d540b1-1
00:02:49.146 --> 00:02:52.000
you'll be able to feel that
pressure.

484f28f7-ea2f-41a1-84f8-4d97cb5dae03-0
00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.280
The syringe will equilibrate.

50423706-55ca-4334-b74d-5c4fe97f5b76-0
00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:03.042
We're going to troubleshoot any
bubbles that are in our syringe

50423706-55ca-4334-b74d-5c4fe97f5b76-1
00:03:03.042 --> 00:03:04.320
by the barrel.

d1294f04-52b6-42ac-bbb5-abdac798db6e-0
00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:08.978
We're going to push that needle
into our vial, and this time we

d1294f04-52b6-42ac-bbb5-abdac798db6e-1
00:03:08.978 --> 00:03:12.880
