surface to clear that bubble.

5e8a9662-78d2-4e71-9919-56e70de99bb1-0
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.375
Then we'll bring the needle tip
back into liquid and we'll

5e8a9662-78d2-4e71-9919-56e70de99bb1-1
00:03:19.375 --> 00:03:24.270
