rid of all of the air that is in

5e8a9662-78d2-4e71-9919-56e70de99bb1-2
00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.160
the syringe.

aef47343-b292-458b-966d-7e2bd806fd72-0
00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:30.557
And we want to make sure that
there's no bubbles from the tip

aef47343-b292-458b-966d-7e2bd806fd72-1
00:03:30.557 --> 00:03:31.680
of that needle.

02e7456d-2be9-4426-b01c-fba6289dbe75-0
00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.640
We need the hub and lumen full
of fluid.

69516cf0-4aa8-44e4-a461-22de61c9d9a8-0
00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.160
We'll change our hand position.

d74e6a91-6a5f-40a0-84cc-225e70bf9751-0
00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:41.000
We'll pull to the volume of our
