This alligated port has a tubing
port that is long and in our

eb6b8863-d53b-4d35-be9e-ccce1b4cfb60-1
00:04:18.986 --> 00:04:19.360
way.

9a61c68b-4dec-4adb-833d-37af51003f8d-0
00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:29.572
We can turn that bag around and
