9a61c68b-4dec-4adb-833d-37af51003f8d-1
00:04:29.572 --> 00:04:30.920
our port.

e6aa2128-297e-4b4f-b4c4-116893773158-0
00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:34.809
We're going to open a sterile
