e2dd4256-ce66-4800-a810-0907eda40a7d-0
00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.640
Now we want to be overhand.

f7429f9c-94a7-466a-85d5-51a970934d47-0
00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:50.197
We'll take our cap off our
syringe and we'll hold on to the

f7429f9c-94a7-466a-85d5-51a970934d47-1
00:04:50.197 --> 00:04:52.120
